    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa butan porte ceapige, ðonne sy he cyninges oferhyrnesse scyldig; ⁊ gange se team þeah forð, oð þæt man wite, hwær he oðstande.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone buys outside a market town, he shall forfeit the sum due to subordinates to the king; but the production of warrantors shall nevertheless be continued, until the point is known at which they can no longer be found.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa butan porte ceapige, ðone sy he cyniges oferhyrnesse scyldig; ⁊ gange se team ðeah forð, oð man wite, hwær he oðstande.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
